docs {
  Operation ID: `get-o-introspect`

  Authenticates the OAuth client itself (client_id plus secret, or the PKCE code exchange) with a form-encoded body; API tokens are not accepted. Read-only request.

  Django action: `apps.api.oauth2.views.IntrospectTokenView.get`
  Source: `apps/api/oauth2/views.py`
}
